---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { publicationPath } from '../lib/site';

const ages = Array.from({ length: 14 }, (_, index) => index + 5);
const ageWords = new Map([
  [5, 'Five'], [6, 'Six'], [7, 'Seven'], [8, 'Eight'], [9, 'Nine'], [10, 'Ten'], [11, 'Eleven'],
  [12, 'Twelve'], [13, 'Thirteen'], [14, 'Fourteen'], [15, 'Fifteen'], [16, 'Sixteen'], [17, 'Seventeen'], [18, 'Eighteen'],
]);
const ageHref = (age: number) => age === 5
  ? publicationPath('five-year-old/#essay-start')
  : publicationPath(`five-year-old/${age}/#essay-start`);
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Wordless — Constraint Grammar of Completed Intelligibility"
  description="A wordless table of contents: Theorem Zero and the complete Five-to-Eighteen developmental reading sequence."
  sourceStatus="Wordless · reader’s table of contents"
>
  <article class="page wordless-page">
    <header class="wordless-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Table of contents</p>
      <h1>Wordless</h1>
      <p class="lede">Before the explanation, there is the moment when something simply arrives. A pattern resolves. A firework lands. A kaleidoscope clicks. We recognise completion before we possess the sentence for it.</p>
      <p class="wordless-riddle">What if understanding begins there?</p>
    </header>

    <section class="zero-ring" aria-labelledby="zero-title">
      <div class="zero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">The ring before the words</p>
        <h2 id="zero-title">Theorem Zero</h2>
        <p>The runtime gives the lawful situation room to resume its own unfolding. It does not tell you what to realise. It restores the conditions in which pattern, relation, completion and release can be encountered before they are explained.</p>
        <a class="zero-link" href={publicationPath('theorem-zero/')}><span>Enter the wordless runtime</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="zero-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="age-section" aria-labelledby="age-title">
      <div class="age-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Then let the words grow</p>
        <h2 id="age-title">Read it at any age.</h2>
        <p>There is no required route. Begin at five, jump to fourteen, swipe sideways, return to seven, or read all fourteen essays in order. Each is another pass over the same underlying problem at a different resolution.</p>
      </div>

      <nav class="age-circus" aria-label="Wordless developmental reading sequence">
        {ages.map((age, index) => (
          <a class="age-ticket" href={ageHref(age)} style={`--i:${index}`}>
            <span class="age-number">{age}</span>
            <span class="age-name">The {ageWords.get(age)}-Year-Old Edition</span>
            <span class="age-action">Enter →</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </section>

    <section class="circus-note">
      <p class="eyebrow">The whole circus</p>
      <h2>Wordless → words → wordless again.</h2>
      <p>The site does not ask everyone to approach intelligibility in the same order. The formal theory, the child-to-adult sequence, the Sentence Receptacle, and the runtime are different entrances into one recurring experience: something was open, something changed, something became enough, and somehow we knew.</p>
      <div class="circus-links">
        <a href={publicationPath('sentence-receptacle/')}>Sentence Receptacle →</a>
        <a href={publicationPath('theory/')}>Formal theory →</a>
        <a href={publicationPath()}>Return to the main entrance →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .wordless-page { max-width: 1040px; }
  .wordless-hero { padding: clamp(3rem,8vw,7rem) 0 4rem; max-width: 860px; }
  .wordless-hero h1 { margin:.2rem 0 1rem; font-size:clamp(4rem,14vw,10rem); line-height:.82; letter-spacing:-.07em; }
  .wordless-hero .lede { max-width:58ch; font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.6vw,1.65rem); }
  .wordless-riddle { margin-top:2rem; font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,3rem); font-style:italic; line-height:1.1; }

  .zero-ring { position:relative; overflow:hidden; min-height:430px; margin:2rem 0 5rem; padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem); display:flex; align-items:center; border:1px solid #263b42; border-radius:28px; background:radial-gradient(circle at 72% 44%,rgba(100,255,210,.14),transparent 26%),linear-gradient(145deg,#071019,#10232c); color:#effaf6; }
  .zero-copy { position:relative; z-index:2; max-width:590px; }
  .zero-copy .eyebrow { color:#9bc7bb; }
  .zero-copy h2 { margin:.25rem 0 1.15rem; font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5.5rem); letter-spacing:-.05em; }
  .zero-copy p:not(.eyebrow) { color:#c8d8d3; font-size:1.06rem; }
  .zero-link { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; margin-top:1.3rem; min-width:min(100%,25rem); padding:.85rem 1rem; border:1px solid rgba(100,255,210,.38); border-radius:999px; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; }
  .zero-link:hover { background:rgba(100,255,210,.09); }
  .zero-link:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #64ffd2; outline-offset:4px; }
  .zero-mark { position:absolute; right:-3rem; top:50%; width:min(44vw,430px); aspect-ratio:1; transform:translateY(-50%); }
  .zero-mark span { position:absolute; inset:0; border:1px solid rgba(100,255,210,.2); border-radius:50%; }
  .zero-mark span:nth-child(2){ inset:17%; border-color:rgba(143,185,255,.24); }
  .zero-mark span:nth-child(3){ inset:34%; border-color:rgba(255,211,110,.3); box-shadow:0 0 70px rgba(100,255,210,.13); }

  .age-section { padding:2rem 0 5rem; }
  .age-intro { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr); gap:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,5rem); align-items:end; margin-bottom:2rem; }
  .age-intro h2 { margin:.25rem 0 0; font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem); line-height:.92; letter-spacing:-.05em; }
  .age-intro > p { max-width:52ch; }
  .age-circus { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.7rem; }
  .age-ticket { min-height:180px; padding:1rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; border:1px solid #d6d0c5; border-radius:18px; color:inherit; text-decoration:none; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#fffdf8,#f4f0e8); transform:translateY(calc((var(--i) % 2) * 16px)); transition:transform .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease,border-color .16s ease; }
  .age-ticket:hover { transform:translateY(calc((var(--i) % 2) * 16px - 5px)) rotate(-.4deg); border-color:#817a70; box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(28,28,25,.08); }
  .age-ticket:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #2f5d50; outline-offset:3px; }
  .age-number { font:800 clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.2rem)/.9 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif; letter-spacing:-.07em; }
  .age-name { margin-top:.8rem; font:700 .75rem/1.3 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif; }
  .age-action { margin-top:auto; padding-top:1rem; color:#6d675f; font:700 .68rem/1 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }

  .circus-note { margin:3rem 0 2rem; padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem); border:1px dashed #b9b1a5; border-radius:28px; background:radial-gradient(circle at 8% 85%,rgba(255,211,110,.16),transparent 24%),radial-gradient(circle at 92% 12%,rgba(100,255,210,.11),transparent 22%),#fffdf8; }
  .circus-note h2 { max-width:15ch; margin:.25rem 0 1rem; font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.4rem); line-height:.95; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .circus-note > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width:64ch; }
  .circus-links { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.8rem 1.4rem; margin-top:1.6rem; font-weight:700; }

  @media(max-width:900px){.age-circus{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.age-ticket{transform:none}.age-ticket:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}}
  @media(max-width:680px){.zero-ring{min-height:520px;align-items:flex-start}.zero-mark{right:-7rem;top:auto;bottom:-7rem;transform:none;width:330px}.age-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr}.age-circus{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.age-ticket{min-height:150px}.circus-links{flex-direction:column}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.age-ticket{transition:none}.age-ticket:hover{transform:none}}
</style>
